%% SOC incident creation. Explained in: docs/components/SOC_Engine.md
flowchart LR
    D[Decisions] & I[Ingested content] & RT[Runtime events] --> SINK[EventSink async]
    SINK --> DET[detect.rs<br/>rules + DSL + baselines]
    DET --> AL[Alert]
    AL --> COR[correlate.rs]
    COR --> INC[Incident + timeline]
    INC --> NAR[narrate.rs → narrative]
    INC --> RESP[respond.rs playbooks]
    RESP --> ACT[freeze / revoke / quarantine]
